[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 14702.87, "timestamp": "04:05:02", "text": "比如你投资了5501，然后你又投资了625。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14704.79, "timestamp": "04:05:04", "text": "你的投资总额就像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14707.59, "timestamp": "04:05:07", "text": "每月5000之类的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14711.349, "timestamp": "04:05:11", "text": "这才是正确的方法。哦"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14714.07, "timestamp": "04:05:14", "text": "是啊，我也是犯错才学到的。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14717.349, "timestamp": "04:05:17", "text": "我想我丢了大概400卢比。那是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14720.309, "timestamp": "04:05:20", "text": "小的。幸好，我损失不大。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14722.229, "timestamp": "04:05:22", "text": "是的，我已经学会了，我不会去"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14723.91, "timestamp": "04:05:23", "text": "因为失去而永远忘记它"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14725.91, "timestamp": "04:05:25", "text": "钱。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14727.91, "timestamp": "04:05:27", "text": "嗯，那是你所知道的最好的事情"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14730.309, "timestamp": "04:05:30", "text": "错误，人生中的错误。学习"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14732.15, "timestamp": "04:05:32", "text": "很多。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14741.83, "timestamp": "04:05:41", "text": "该死。沉默太吵了，老兄。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14744.389, "timestamp": "04:05:44", "text": "出去。我当时正在考虑这件事。哇，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14747.99, "timestamp": "04:05:47", "text": "这里面包含的东西太多了，老兄。这"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14751.67, "timestamp": "04:05:51", "text": "它太大了。这太过分了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14754.63, "timestamp": "04:05:54", "text": "是啊，说实话，感觉太过了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14757.75, "timestamp": "04:05:57", "text": "向某人透露了过多的信息"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14759.75, "timestamp": "04:05:59", "text": "在同一点。点赞"}]